                    <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-2">Top Universities in Lithuania: Rankings & Fees</h1>
                    <p class="lead text-justify" style="text-align: justify">
                        Lithuania, a vibrant country in Northern Europe, is becoming a hub for international students thanks to its high-quality education system and affordable tuition fees. Students seeking quality education at an affordable cost are choosing Lithuania. With its rich history, modern campuses, and a strong emphasis on academic excellence, Lithuania offers a variety of university options to match every career goal.
                        <br />
                        <br />
                        Students can choose from respected institutions such as Vilnius University, renowned for its tradition and research; Vytautas Magnus University, known for its innovative liberal arts approach and global outlook; and Mykolas Romeris University, a leader in social sciences and law. Whether you want a welcoming academic environment, internationally recognized degrees, or low living expenses, Lithuania provides a well-rounded experience for students from all over the world.
                        <br />
                        <br />
                        This article will guide you through the highlights of each institution and help you discover why Lithuania has become a preferred destination for higher education.
                    </p>
